BB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Random\" title=\"Random\">Random</a></b>, level ~5 chests/rewards\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Proof_Against_Poison\" title=\"Proof Against Poison\"> Proof Against Poison +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Proof_Against_Poison\" title=\"Proof Against Poison\"> Proof Against Poison +6</a>:</b> This item grants its wearer immunity to natural poisons. This item also grants a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to saving throws against magical poisons, and the wearer does not fail saving throws against them on a roll of a natural 1 (this renders the wearer immune to magical poisons with a DC of less than 7 + their Fortitude save).</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Periapt_of_Proof_Against_Poison.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Periapt_of_Proof_Against_Poison.png/420px-Periapt_of_Proof_Against_Poison.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"255\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Periapt_of_Proof_Again